; A `main` answering `(Result Int Error)` with failure: `axiom:`
; plus the rendering writes to fd 2, and the process exits 70 -
; beside the runtime's own 71 and 72 (ERR-REC-4). The `.err` golden
; holds the sentence; stdout stays empty.
(import Err)

(:: main (Result Int Error))
(fn (main)
  (withContext (Err (mkError 7 "disk full")) "saving records"))
